    "title": "FishTrippers Village Liber Tango",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Made in Japan by hand in high density polyurethane.</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><br /><span>It is an excellent lure for kingfish, tuna and pelagic fish.</span><br /><span>Its swimming action during recovery is ultimate with extreme movements in the water!</span><br /><span>An important sintillation on its flat sides stimulates the instinct of the big predators.</span></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p style=\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Lenght 200 mm</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Gr. 83</p></li></ul>",
